{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Conquest Tactics: Realm of Sin</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelite that combines turn-based strategy and tactical gameplay. Step into a world torn by chaos and sin as a Commander whose choices will shape the fate of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/80ed24c12ae25d1785d0846bca9f3f0a.webp?t=1772445919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras_big/80ed24c12ae25d1785d0846bca9f3f0a.webp?t=1772445919 width=1560 height=62 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/ce6e39d648e42e365cdc8aa84ef2c448.avif?t=1772445919\" width=1560 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/b5df104d7ea13b647c6a4bfb1c1db12d.poster.avif?t=1772445919\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/b5df104d7ea13b647c6a4bfb1c1db12d.webm?t=1772445919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/b5df104d7ea13b647c6a4bfb1c1db12d.mp4?t=1772445919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Master the art of tactical, turn-based combat where every move counts. Enter the Commanding State to position your units with precision, rotating, moving, and deploying them strategically. Will you play it safe or take bold risks to achieve victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/80ed24c12ae25d1785d0846bca9f3f0a.webp?t=1772445919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras_big/80ed24c12ae25d1785d0846bca9f3f0a.webp?t=1772445919 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/ae781bf639399b207485768d2a494e09.avif?t=1772445919\" width=1560 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/626523bea8a0b2142ce0c41dbc87971d.poster.avif?t=1772445919\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/626523bea8a0b2142ce0c41dbc87971d.webm?t=1772445919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/626523bea8a0b2142ce0c41dbc87971d.mp4?t=1772445919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Navigate a realm steeped in darkness, where the unique Sin system makes each decision impactful. Travel the world map, advancing time and increasing Threat Levels with each move, as foes grow deadlier and choices grow heavier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/80ed24c12ae25d1785d0846bca9f3f0a.webp?t=1772445919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras_big/80ed24c12ae25d1785d0846bca9f3f0a.webp?t=1772445919 width=1560 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/6f675cc6bafcf2b5f03b8e075713ba30.avif?t=1772445919\" width=1560 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/fded29c1a3247d566c4897a443205feb.poster.avif?t=1772445919\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/fded29c1a3247d566c4897a443205feb.webm?t=1772445919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/fded29c1a3247d566c4897a443205feb.mp4?t=1772445919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Explore diverse, dangerous environments, from Shrines to the Sunlight Cathedral, each filled with secrets and challenges. Confront powerful enemies, forge alliances, and leave a mark on this world where every choice has consequences. Will you bring order to the chaos, or will darkness prevail?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/c41d1c16ee8072f26498d907cf67e3e0.avif?t=1772445919\" width=1560 height=325 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras/b72d2a4b8ca4e3d25814026f5c09dd53.avif?t=1772445919\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308960/extras_big/b72d2a4b8ca4e3d25814026f5c09dd53.webp?t=1772445919 width=1560 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_par